                                "example_id": "893fe283-118a-4e9e-9044-a39ce77182f6",
                                "sense_id": "7ba57f44-7db6-39b6-b99a-dea3d914339c",
                                "text": "His near-perfect stat line (25 of 30 passing, 235 yards, 2 TDs, 0 INTs) could have improved if Jamal Agnew had not dropped a would-be touchdown on a deep crossing route late in the second quarter, but here’s a guess that Jacksonville won’t quibble about it."
